{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>With length of days:</b> Its meaning is וּבְאֹרֶךְ יָמִים (and with length of days)." "<b>The bet in בַּיִּשִּׁישִׁים (among the aged):</b> It serves for itself and afterwards together with what follows, like: וָאֵרָא אֶל אַבְרָהָם אֶל יִצְחָק וְאֶל יַעֲקֹב בְּאֵל שַׁדָּי (and I appeared to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob as El Shaddai)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:29.908472570Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}